🗺️ Knowledge Graph — Complete Guide
 
Notes alone are just files. Linked together = a second brain. ✅
 
 
 
🎯 What Is a Knowledge Graph?
 
A Knowledge Graph is a network of your notes connected by links and tags. Instead of isolated folders → your ideas find each other.
 
plaintext  
Project Overview ──→ Architecture ──→ Conventions
       ↓                  ↓              ↓
    Workflows ────────→ Repair-Loop ←─── Providers
       ↓
  Related Topics ←── MOCs ←── Individual Notes
 
 
 
 
