🧱 Core Concepts
 
Concept What It Means 
Atomic Notes One idea = one note. Keep notes focused & short 
Wiki-Links  [[Note Name]]  — connect notes directly 
Backlinks Which other notes link to this note (auto-generated) 
MOC Map of Content — an index page linking to a group of related notes 
Tags Categorize across topics:  #area/active ,  #project/xyz ,  #resource/book  
Bidirectional Link When A links to B → B shows A in backlinks 
 
 
 
