🔗 How to Link Notes
 
Basic Wiki-Link
 
markdown  
See also: [[Architecture — System Overview]]
 
 
→ Shows as: See also: [[Architecture — System Overview]]
 
Link + Custom Display Text
 
markdown  
Check the [[conventions.md|coding standards]] before writing code.
 
 
Link to a Section
 
markdown  
Read about [[providers.md#-failover--circuit-breaker|Failover & Circuit Breaker]]
 
 
Embed a Note
 
markdown  
![[note-name.md]]
 
 
💡 Best Practice
 
- ✅ Link when it makes sense — not every word
- ✅ Every note should link out to at least 2–3 related notes
- ✅ Every important topic should have a MOC pointing to all relevant notes
- ❌ Don't over-link — one concept = one primary note
 
 
 
