🏷️ Tagging Strategy
 
Tags = categories. Use consistently across all notes.
 
🏷️ Recommended Tag Schema
 
Category Format Examples 
Note Type  type/xxx   type/note ,  type/moc ,  type/reference ,  type/template  
Project  project/name   project/crystalcastlex ,  project/fastapi  
Area  area/domain   area/dev ,  area/ai ,  area/docs  
Status  status/xxx   status/draft ,  status/active ,  status/archived  
Priority  priority/level   priority/high ,  priority/later  
 
