✅ Maintenance Routine
 
Frequency Task 
Daily (5 min) Add 1–2 links in today's note → link back to 1 existing note 
Weekly (30 min) Review 1 MOC → add missing links → remove dead links → update descriptions 
Monthly (1 hr) Check Orphaned Notes (no incoming links) → connect them or move to archive Check Empty Files → complete or delete Update main [[Index]] MOC 
 
🧹 Quick Health Checks
 
plaintext  
1. Search: -[[]]  → find notes with NO outgoing links → connect them!
2. Search: file:"MOC" → review your entry points
3. Search: tag:status/draft → finalize or archive drafts
 
 
 
 
